rt Template</h1><p class=\"text-[18px] leading-[1.5] text-gold-text mb-6\">Four questions, answered in one page.</p><p class=\"text-[16.5px] leading-[1.7] text-muted max-w-[620px] mb-4\">What worked, what did not, why, and what changes next month — with the metrics that belong under each. The reporting format we use with clients, which is deliberately one page rather than forty charts.</p><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-2 max-w-[620px]\"><span class=\"text-muted\">Use it to </span>Report to yourself, your board or your client without a dashboard export.</p></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-7 py-7\"><p class=\"neb-label mb-2.5\">In preparation</p><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">This one is still being written. Leave your email on any other download and we will send it across when it is ready.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Also free</span><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/resources/festival-calendar\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[18px] leading-[1.25] mb-2.5\">Indian Festival Marketing Calendar</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Every major festival, with the lead time each one needs.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Get it<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M